<title>UK: SCA Group sets 200 million mark exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>SCA Group sets 200 million mark exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SCA GROUP HOLDING BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  Svenska Cellulosa AB</p>
<p> AMT   *200 MLN DEM   COUPON   **2.50	MATURITY    01.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE   EXCHANGEABLE  ISS PRICE  ***	 PAY DATE</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 REOFFER    ***	 YTM	 **3.75-4.25</p>
<p> NOTES     *APPROXIMATE</p>
<p>	    **INDICATED</p>
<p>	   ***TO BE PRICED ON OR BEFORE 17.APR.97</p>
<p>		EXCHANGEABLE INTO INDUSTRIVARDEN A SHARES AT</p>
<p>		INDICATED EXCHANGE PREMIUM OF 12-16 PCT.</p>
<p>		TWO YEARS HARD NON CALL THEREAFTER CALLABLE AT</p>
<p>		ACCRETED VALUE SUBJECT TO 130 PCT RULE</p>
<p>		LONG FIRST COUPON TO 01.JUL.98</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
